---
name: room-events
description: Test room events with explicit roles and outcomes.
engine: 0.2.0-lab.1
roles: [sender, receiver]
---
"""
Sessionless notices share schema and routing rules without creating a session.
"""
contract @4h mentions 1 => expired

"""
You are the sender. Post a notice to the room when a build or review needs attention, mark it
urgent only when it is, and close the session when you are done.
"""
role sender

"""
You are the receiver. Read each notice and act on the urgent ones first.
"""
role receiver

"""
Tell the room about a build or a review. Set urgent only when it needs attention now.
"""
type notice
  topic: enum(build|review)
  urgent: boolean

"""
Close the session. No more session messages follow.
"""
type close

"""
The session is open. Notices go to the room outside it; the sender closes the session.
"""
state new
  sender -> receiver: close() => complete

"""
The host applies its own windowed room-event quota.
"""
room
  event sender -> receiver: notice()

"""
The sender closed the session. Room notices may continue outside it.
"""
end complete

"""
The four-hour contract clock ran out. Send nothing more in this session.
"""
end expired
